1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,360
Para onde vai a chuva

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,860
deste telhado?

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,000
A inclinação

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,840
leva a água até a calha.

5
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,290
No fim da calha,

6
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:10,220
um cano conduz a água

7
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,740
para baixo.

8
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,200
A água entra

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:14,980
na cisterna

10
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,730
e o nível sobe.

